  "title": "Cauliflower Tot and Turkey Sausage Breakfast Casserole",
  "description": "This breakfast egg casserole is made with wholesome ingredients like turkey sausage and frozen cauliflower tots, and is easy to make ahead too!",
  "authors": [
    "LKB"
  ],
  "date_published": "2021-09-21T20:41:48-04:00",
